                        ]
                    ]
                ],
                [
                    "description",
                    "Bypassing Network Perimeter: Cellular connections can create unauthorized pathways\ninto OT networks, bypassing traditional security controls\n• Visibility Gaps: IT security teams may not even know cellular devices exist in OT\nenvironments\n• Legacy Integration: When connected to older OT equipment without security features,\nthe router becomes a critical attack vector\n• Physical Security: Devices in remote locations may be physically accessible to attackers"
